n=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.8&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb header_2_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#007740&Prime; header_2_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb35px\u00a0\u00bb custom_margin=\u00a0\u00bb51px|||||\u00a0\u00bb global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb]<\/p>\n<h2>Nos valeurs<\/h2>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\u00a0\u00bb2_5&Prime; _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb][et_pb_image src=\u00a0\u00bbhttps:\/\/demainlaterre.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Demain-la-Terre-Racines.jpg\u00a0\u00bb title_text=\u00a0\u00bbDemain-la-Terre-Racines\u00a0\u00bb _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb custom_margin=\u00a0\u00bb52px|||||\u00a0\u00bb global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb custom_padding=\u00a0\u00bb9px|||||\u00a0\u00bb global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb][et_pb_column type=\u00a0\u00bb4_4&Prime; _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb][et_pb_text _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb text_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#574121&Prime; text_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb18px\u00a0\u00bb text_line_height=\u00a0\u00bb1.8em\u00a0\u00bb header_2_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#007740&Prime; header_2_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb20px\u00a0\u00bb header_2_line_height=\u00a0\u00bb1.3em\u00a0\u00bb custom_margin=\u00a0\u00bb||2px|||\u00a0\u00bb global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb]<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cultiver les talents n&rsquo;est pas qu&rsquo;une promesse environnementale : c&rsquo;est l&rsquo;engagement de notre r\u00e9seau pour une agriculture durable. Convaincus que cette transformati